  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "4733996b-fc49-4b3d-bef2-4a9c9b7d648f",
    "name": "API Testing Assignment",
    "description": "# API Testing Assignment\n\n## Objective\n\nThis collection demonstrates API testing using the ReqRes API and Postman.\n\n## Topics Covered\n\n- REST API\n    \n- HTTP methods: GET, POST, PUT, PATCH, DELETE\n    \n- HTTP status codes\n    \n- API key authentication\n    \n- Request headers\n    \n- Query parameters\n    \n- Path parameters\n    \n- JSON request bodies\n    \n- XML request bodies\n    \n- Form-data\n    \n- Raw text\n    \n- Response validation\n    \n- Dynamic data\n    \n- API chaining\n    \n- API mocking\n    \n- API documentation\n    \n- Test scripts\n    \n\n## API Base URL\n\n{{baseUrl}}\n\n## Authentication\n\nReqRes API key is passed using the `x-api-key` request header.\n\n## Content Types Tested\n\n- application/json\n    \n- application/xml\n    \n- multipart/form-data\n    \n- text/plain\n    \n\n## Mock API\n\nA Postman local mock API is also included in this collection.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "57182481",
    "_collection_link": "https://go.postman.co/collection/57182481-4733996b-fc49-4b3d-bef2-4a9c9b7d648f?source=collection_link"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "06 - Content Type Tests",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "06.1 - JSON Request",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 201\", function () {\r",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);\r",
                  "});\r",
                  "\r",
                  "pm.test(\"Response content type is JSON\", function () {\r",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get(\"Content-Type\"))\r",
                  "        .to.include(\"application/json\");\r",
                  "});\r",
                  "\r",
                  "pm.test(\"Response contains name\", function () {\r",
                  "    const response = pm.response.json();\r",
                  "\r",
                  "    pm.expect(response.name).to.eql(\"Ansh\");\r",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "packages": {},
                "requests": {}
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "x-api-key",
                "value": "{{apiKey}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
